Daily article mailing list bot for daily-article-l@lists.wikimedia.org:
<https://lists.wikimedia.org/mailman/listinfo/daily-article-l>.

Dependencies:
* Python 3
** BeautifulSoup 4 module, imported as "bs4"
   (<https://www.crummy.com/software/BeautifulSoup/bs4/doc/>)

The MediaWiki API is queried with the standard library's "urllib.request"
module, so no wiki client library is needed.

Fill out "config.py.sample" appropriately and move the file to "config.py" in
the same directory as "dal.py". Be sure to restrict read permissions on
"config.py" and on the "__pycache__" directory, which caches a compiled copy of
it.

